    "chunk_text": "ende Sona \u00fe\u00e6s on \u00fe\u00e6m \u00e6fterran geare gefor Sempronius se consul mid firde wi\u00f0 Pencentes Italia folc. \u00dea mi\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee hi hie getrymed h\u00e6fdon, & tog\u00e6dere woldon, \u00fea wear\u00f0 eor\u00febeofung, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6g\u00f0er & hie \u00feeah swa ondr\u00e6dendlice gebidon \u00fe\u00e6t se ege ofergongen w\u00e6s, & \u00fe\u00e6r si\u00fe\u00fean w\u00e6lgrimlice \u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6s se m\u00e6sta blodgyte on \u00e6g\u00f0ere healfe \u00feara folca, \u00feeh \u00fee Romane sige h\u00e6fden, \u00fea feawa \u00fee \u00de\u00e6r w\u00e6s gesiene \u00fe\u00e6t seo eor\u00febeofung tacnade \u00fea miclan bloddryncas \u00fee hiere mon on \u00fe\u00e6re tide to \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s IIII hunde wintrum & LXXX, gemong \u00fe\u00e6m o\u00ferum On \u00f0\u00e6m dagum Cartaginenses sendon fultum Tarentinum, \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00fee i\u00f0 mehton wi\u00fe Romanum. \u00dea sendon Romane \u00e6rendracan to him, & hie acsedon for hwy hie \u00f0\u00e6t dyden. \u00dea o\u00f0sworan hie \u00fe\u00e6m \u00e6rendracan mid \u00fe\u00e6m bismerlicestan a\u00f0e \u00fe\u00e6t hie him n\u00e6fre on fultume On \u00f0\u00e6m dagum Ulcinienses & Thrusci \u00f0a folc forneah ealle forwurdon for hiora agnum dysige. For \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee hie sume heora \u00feeowas gefreodon, & eac him eallum wurdon to milde & to \u00dea of\u00feuhte heora ceorlum \u00fe\u00e6t mon \u00fea \u00feeowas freode, & hi nolde. \u00dea wi\u00f0sawon hie \u00fe\u00e6m hlafordum, & \u00fea \u00feeowas mid",
